{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flow of Self-Healing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.poster.avif?t=1758854780\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.webm?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.mp4?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a peaceful and soothing environment that effortlessly helps you enter a flow state. Enjoy a selection of calming music and white noise, complemented by the gentle movements of fish and the flowing water in a beautifully landscaped aquarium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/17a43c661185c28d2aaf9db40ceaf179.poster.avif?t=1758854780\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/17a43c661185c28d2aaf9db40ceaf179.webm?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your focus tasks and use time management tools like the Pomodoro timer to cultivate better focus habits and stay concentrated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colorful Aquarium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.poster.avif?t=1758854780\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.webm?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.mp4?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Fish Only!&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various unique fish.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them to help them grow, and personalize their home with a variety of decorative elements for a richer focus experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed rare and one-of-a-kind fish\u2014new life always brings surprises!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game encyclopedia to discover fascinating facts about each fish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ongoing Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.poster.avif?t=1758854780\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.webm?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.mp4?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your focus also nurtures your aquarium\u2014complete tasks to earn extra coins! Whether you're studying, working, or just taking a mental break, a group of adorable fish will always be there to keep you company.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649550?t=1758854780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649550?t=1758854780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/dfd901ae69fca03ce4d88d37221d95d5505ea12b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758854780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/dfd901ae69fca03ce4d88d37221d95d5505ea12b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758854780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flow of Self-Healing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.poster.avif?t=1758854780\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.webm?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649550/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.mp4?t=1758854780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a peaceful and soothing environment that effortlessly helps you enter a flow state. E